Package: xfce4
Name: Xfce 4 lightweight desktop environment
Version: 4.16.1
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Maintainer: Max Leiter <maxwell.leiter@gmail.com>
Author: Max Leiter <maxwell.leiter@gmail.com>
Depends: xfwm4, xfce4-panel, xfce4-settings, xfce4-session, xfdesktop4, xfce4-appfinder, thunar, libxfce4ui-2-0, libgarcon-1-0, libexo-2-0, libxfce4util7, xfconf, libwnck-3-0, libstartup-notification0, dbus, iosc (>= 0.9.34), xwayland (>= 23.2.7+ios4)
Recommends: x11-fonts-sf
Section: X11
Priority: optional
Description: Xfce 4.16 desktop environment for rootless iOS (metapackage)
 Installs the full lightweight Xfce 4.16 desktop built on the cross-compiled
 GTK3/X11 stack for rootless /var/jb: the window manager (xfwm4), panel,
 desktop, settings manager, session manager, file manager (Thunar) and the
 application finder, plus the Xfce libraries and their new dependencies
 (xfconf/D-Bus, libwnck-3, startup-notification).
 .
 This is a metapackage: it pulls in the components, GTK3 runtime, and the
 hardware Xwayland path. Start Xwayland under iosc, then bring the session up
 with bin/xfce-up.sh on DISPLAY :1.
